cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "SYNTH Benchmark: Tabular Synthetic Data Generator Evaluation"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-07-15
authors:
  - family-names: Battineni
    given-names: Gopi
    email: gopi.chandu89@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/gopibattineni/SYNTH_BENCHMARK"
url: "https://github.com/gopibattineni/SYNTH_BENCHMARK"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible benchmark comparing eight tabular synthetic data generators
  across fifteen datasets on utility (TRTR/TSTR), fidelity (distribution
  similarity), and privacy (membership inference), with automated statistical
  analysis and publication-ready figures.
keywords:
  - synthetic data
  - tabular data
  - benchmarking
  - privacy
  - fidelity
  - utility
  - generative models
